{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"熊本県をはじめ九州地方で起きた地震。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未だに余震が続いているようで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日幕張メッセで行われた握手会会場で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急遽、募金箱を設置致しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご協力してくださった会場のみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ以上被害が拡大しないよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"祈るばかりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/04/19/4460888/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセ2days"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会のミニライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遥かなるブータン初披露しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滑らかな動きはやはり自分に合います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊りでいうならバレッタも楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振りが入ったことによって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲が好きになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ首の動き真似してください∠( 'ω')／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして握手レーンは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんとペアでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん党の皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生オーディション前のエピソードに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなびっくりしてたね( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はかりんちゃんとはそういう関係なの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/04/19/4460888/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"王手！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/04/19/4460888/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガウンは同色で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刺繍が入ってるのが可愛いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンズもので丈長かったの短くしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミシンをやっと使いこなせるようになった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/04/19/4460888/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サテンのぱじゃま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/04/19/4460888/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店長、新人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当日、強風の中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に来ていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、大丈夫でしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドアルバムの話だったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーの話だったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お酒の話だったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪染めた染めてないの話だったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVの感想だったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症の話だったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この二日間でみんなに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気をもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちが保てず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまくいかないことがたくさんあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事としてもそうですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回起きた地震に対して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がグループの一人としても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人としても、少しでもできることを、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}